<title>USA: FORECAST - Estimates of API data for Jan 10 week.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Estimates of API data for Jan 10 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>(STOCKS IN THOUSAND/BBLS, CHANGES IN MLN/BBLS)</p>
<p>REUTER SURVEY ESTIMATES*	   ACTUAL STOCKS FOR</p>
<p>FOR WEEK ENDED 01/10/97	    WEEK ENDED 01/03/97-CHANGE</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CRUDE......... UP 2.30 million bbls    286,125	DN 9.473 MLN</p>
<p>DISTILLATE.... DN 1.00 million bbls    126,743	UP 2.942 MLN</p>
<p>GASOLINE...... UP 2.10 million bbls    196,009	UP 4.260 MLN</p>
<p>UTILIZATION... DN 0.50 pct pts     92.3 PCT	  0.00 PCT PT</p>
<p>*NB - The survey estimate is derived by omitting the high and the low forecast and averaging the rest.</p>
</text>
